# .gitignore file for HDF5

# Java .classes files
**/java/.classes

# Backup files
# Editor-specific extensions should go in your ~/.gitconfig, but we
# include the standard Unix backup '~' extension since autoheader
# backs up H5config.h.in when it creates a new one and the
# extension is always '~'.
**/*~

# Other files, most of which are created by scripts in bin/
/build*
src/H5config.h.in

/.classpath
.claude/
/CLAUDE.md
/CMakeUserPresets.json

# Local-only VFD SWMR port planning/design docs -- kept on disk for reference,
# not checked in.
/VFD_SWMR_PORT_PLAN.md
/docs/H5PB_index_design_analysis.md
/docs/H5PB_restore_hashtable_plan.md
/docs/VFD_SWMR_config_TOML_migration_plan.md
HDF5Examples/CMakeUserPresets.json
/CLAUDE.md

# Build/test artifact files that should never be committed
/pac_Cconftest.out
/log_vfd_out.log
/splitter*.h5
/splitter*.log
/sec2_file.h5
/stdio_file.h5
/test_table.h5

# Emacs temporary and lock files
*~
\#*\#
.\#*


#Ignore vscode AI rules
.github/instructions/codacy.instructions.md
